# allowlist 模式：預設全忽略，逐項核准追蹤（F11 制度：手寫設定入版控，runtime/secret 一律排除）
# 追蹤原則：手寫或生成的「設定與指令檔」→ 追蹤；app 自管 state / 憑證 / DB / session / cache / log → 排除
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!hooks.json
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!rules/
!rules/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!agents/
!agents/*.toml
!prompts/
!prompts/**
!.github/
!.github/**
# .DS_Store 是 Finder state 非設定；必須放在 ! 規則之後才蓋得掉 !hooks/** 的誤收
.DS_Store
# 明確永不追蹤（即使日後放寬 allowlist）：
# stitch.env — 明文 secret（chmod 600；config.toml 以 env_http_headers 引用其 env var 名）
# config.toml — key 已外部化後仍不追蹤：marketplaces 區塊為 app 自管 state（高頻改寫）
# auth.json / *.sqlite / history.jsonl / log/ / sessions/ — 憑證與 runtime state

# Reviewed Ponytail downstream patch and its exact baseline; runtime payload stays ignored.
!maintenance/
!maintenance/ponytail/
!maintenance/ponytail/README.md
!maintenance/ponytail/LICENSE
!maintenance/ponytail/ponytail.patch
!maintenance/ponytail/baseline-manifest.json
!maintenance/ponytail/base/
!maintenance/ponytail/base/hooks/
!maintenance/ponytail/base/hooks/ponytail-instructions.js
!maintenance/ponytail/base/skills/
!maintenance/ponytail/base/skills/ponytail/
!maintenance/ponytail/base/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md
!maintenance/ponytail/.agents/
!maintenance/ponytail/.agents/plugins/
!maintenance/ponytail/.agents/plugins/marketplace.json
!maintenance/ponytail/model-evidence.json
!maintenance/ponytail/exposure.json
!maintenance/ponytail/exposure-evidence.json
